This file contains some guidelines for distribution in Sailfish OS.

Commit changes to Cargo.lock to keep the versions in check.
Only build locked versions of the crate.

To downgrade dependencies to supported versions, use 'cargo update --precise <version> crate_name' command.

Update licenses of dependencies by running cargo-about whenever Cargo.lock changes:

    cargo about generate --frozen third-party.hbs > LICENSES/THIRD-PARTY.txt

This file must be included in the RPM.
